    {
      "text": "Macro has clearly cut high beta AI valuations over the past few months. But I try to stay focused on fundamentals.\n\nIf you're curious about my take though:\n\nWe're seeing record visibility with\n- memory (2031), photonics (2029-2030), etc LTAs\n-  $NBIS,",
