      ],
      "is_retweet": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Yep, with $NVDA investing $3.5B into Mediatek.\n\nIt does feel like Nvidia is playing kingmaker with the next generation of ASIC winners like $MRVL / Mediatek, with a second order effect of eroding $AVGO position.\n\nPlaybook feels similar to what they did with Neoclouds like $NBIS",
