    {
      "text": "Today, $NVDA has announced a $3.5B investment into Mediatek. \n\nIt appears Nvidia is \"networking\" itself into the broader ASIC ecosystem, from $MRVL to MediaTek.\n\nAnd have future ecosystems aligned with Nvidia standards. (maybe to fend off $AVGO as well) https://t.co/okdGKS51U3",
