      ],
      "is_retweet": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Remember my $SOI thesis anon? Soitec interview commentary today:\n\n- 80% of capacity reservation agreements expected within 1-2 weeks, with more than 10 in total. \n\n-  $200M Photonics-SOI revenue now described as \"absolutely a floor\"\n\n$TSM also sees SiPH going mainstream in 2027 https://t.co/FpWKYvHupG",
