      "time": "2026-08-31 18:56",
      "cashtags": [
        "SOI",
        "TSM"
      ],
      "is_retweet": false
    },
    {
      "text": "“Memory is a bubble.”Explain this then, KOSPI bears:\n\nSamsung has reportedly reserved ~70% of its memory production capacity through 2031 via LTAs with $NVDA, $MSFT, and $GOOGL as main counterparties.\n\nFive years of demand visibility… https://t.co/GUGWTkXkMc",
      "url": "https://twitter.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2094365307876040857",
      "time": "2026-08-31 18:02",
      "cashtags": [
        "GOOGL",
