        "NVDA"
      ],
      "is_retweet": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Imagine Celestial ($MRVL acquisition) was public. \n\nThe valuation would probably be astronomical in US markets (if I had to guess, $6-10B)\n\nBecause 2028 revenue projections were $500m (q4 annualized runrate), 2029 revenue projections were $1B.\n\nAnd because Celestial is a core",
